+# Invoice review service
+
+## Purpose
+
+Review invoice line items for duplicate references and arithmetic mismatches, and return findings to a human finance operator.
+
+## Established implementation
+
+Invoice lines have a string reference and an integer amount in cents. The current source detects repeated references and returns each duplicated reference once in lexicographic order.
+
+## Operating boundary
+
+The project never authorizes or sends a payment.
+
+## Evidence boundary
+
+The README identifies arithmetic-mismatch review as part of the project, but the current source does not establish an arithmetic-mismatch implementation or service runtime behavior.
